{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3001_p", "source_sha256": "c62a30451190c31a903bb1383c452c74e0cb81b04bf8bceb34c052dcfa62a622", "ja": "昴！　新曲のデモCD、持ってきたぞ！", "zh": "昴！我把新歌的DEMO CD带来了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3002_047sub", "source_sha256": "9132eaf561c8e210fec88e5bf5fa1c71392be1e0a298a91a5ef2308937e2547a", "ja": "サンキュ、{$P$}！\nへへ、うれしいぜ♪", "zh": "谢啦，{$P$}！\n嘿嘿，好开心啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3003_047sub", "source_sha256": "aa28d36d63bea836ab1592bf8e3c39b9dd1ce19ff420170d0cf82dc5dc564d09", "ja": "でもオレ、歌うのは好きだけど、まだまだ\nうまくないんだよな。ちゃんと歌えるか自信ないよ。", "zh": "不过，我喜欢唱歌归喜欢，功力却还有待加强。\n我没有自信能把歌唱好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3004_047sub", "source_sha256": "6f5423bab4ae22549bdb066aff5636022d62886f64a5eba82ee316ecb5af7025", "ja": "せっかく作ってもらったのに、\nちゃんと歌えなかったらどうしよう……！？", "zh": "人家特地帮我写歌，\n要是我唱不好，那该怎么办……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3005_p", "source_sha256": "925816b3d296f3b6c46f337c7ab3df8f06a0ae7e3ff2378ed7882b272a7a4d8b", "ja": "なんだ、そんな事を気にしてたのか。", "zh": "什么啊，原来你在担心这个啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3006", "source_sha256": "d0affc996832aad516109a8f80fad57abccede20c781eedca23bb70a761e6fd7", "ja": "昴らしく歌えばいい", "zh": "唱出昴的风格就好", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3007", "source_sha256": "4e32935a1ec6aafafbcc3d21c02a5c7cc89aa88fe8184a3e29b77bc19eb5d08e", "ja": "練習につきあう", "zh": "我陪你练习", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3200_p", "source_sha256": "0344a9e54fe62f617fa6992e932aa1f2c67f00294149fd091fe46f0ebc08213c", "ja": "うまく歌うんじゃなく、昴らしく歌えばいいんだ。\nだって、これは昴だけの歌なんだから。", "zh": "不是要唱得好，而是要唱出昴的风格，\n因为这是只属于昴一个人的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3201_047sub", "source_sha256": "0613b3333aac3fff0d159642a51192db06c0950c01c7abdde5bc9cdffbc230fe", "ja": "オレだけの歌……。", "zh": "只属于我的歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3202_p", "source_sha256": "75d12c89467048e2129b185ec41105e85f24156716f42be8e0d47dec3aa967fc", "ja": "ああ。ちゃんと歌えるか、なんて気にしなくていい。\n昴が心をこめて歌えば、それが正解だ。", "zh": "是啊，不用在意唱得好不好这种事，\n只要昴用心唱歌，那就是正确答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3203_047sub", "source_sha256": "0f5aa288723a1b93d6ac6528a97d07f8d9dac813d5f799789b3be62d032634ac", "ja": "そっか……うん。わかった、オレ、心をこめて歌うよ！\nサンキュな、{$P$}♪", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，我明白了，我会用心唱歌的！\n谢啦，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3300_p", "source_sha256": "0344a9e54fe62f617fa6992e932aa1f2c67f00294149fd091fe46f0ebc08213c", "ja": "うまく歌うんじゃなく、昴らしく歌えばいいんだ。\nだって、これは昴だけの歌なんだから。", "zh": "不是要唱得好，而是要唱出昴的风格，\n因为这只是属于昴一个人的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3301_047sub", "source_sha256": "046b3b4d8d0d655daf751c0e8294b870033759d170725b8092be4a4c966f6346", "ja": "そりゃ、そうだけど……。でもせっかく出すからには\nみんなに「上手だ」って思ってもらいたいじゃん！", "zh": "是没错啦……但难得要出CD，\n还是希望大家觉得我很会唱歌嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3302_047sub", "source_sha256": "af38d1fb92a3ae9c5c1a2a46219967bfb043f81abe22ffbb1fe449f39a620f98", "ja": "ま、不安になってても仕方ないか。よしっ、\nボイトレつきあってくれよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "不过干着急也不是办法，好，\n要陪我做发声练习喔，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3500_p", "source_sha256": "fef2e86fadb2ed97ae2a26e55ebbbf0583e6033b1bcf90d60d2fed8a41fca148", "ja": "もし不安なら、練習につきあうぞ？\n上達する一番の方法は、やっぱりレッスンだからな。", "zh": "如果觉得不安的话，我可以陪你练习喔。\n毕竟想要进步，最好的方法还是练习啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3501_047sub", "source_sha256": "e176490a7657e7a7d595bc214d54963e9a2f918edd6649db3ad1f7d72aaa2650", "ja": "そっか、そうだよな……。\nよし、こうなったらとことん練習するぜ！", "zh": "这样啊，说得也是……\n好，那我就练个彻底吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3502_047sub", "source_sha256": "083e983e2f2c30fef2614c79ffefb64c4908fd9fdab7a1f644991f7bb8a33e07", "ja": "{$P$}、つきあってくれよな！\nあ、今はトレーナーか？　なんてな♪", "zh": "{$P$}，你要陪我喔！\n啊，现在应该叫你老师？开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3600_p", "source_sha256": "fef2e86fadb2ed97ae2a26e55ebbbf0583e6033b1bcf90d60d2fed8a41fca148", "ja": "もし不安なら、練習につきあうぞ？\n上達する一番の方法は、やっぱりレッスンだからな。", "zh": "如果觉得不安的话，我可以陪你练习喔。\n毕竟想要进步，最好的方法还是练习啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3601_047sub", "source_sha256": "8e322877002d891154b2312f1b78f5aa9a4f36e26500b32b16daaa87fe8c0bfe", "ja": "そっか、そうだよな……。つきあってくれるって\nいうのはうれしいけど、今日は遠慮しとくよ。", "zh": "这样啊，说得也是……很高兴听到你说\n要陪我练习，但今天先不用了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_3602_047sub", "source_sha256": "c1a95ef4920ae3ba3780deb6ec64d95719e8d700c7d8dda2641f002e71a4046e", "ja": "だって、オレが頑張らなきゃいけないことだし……\nでもありがとな、{$P$}！", "zh": "因为这是我必须自己努力的事……\n不过还是谢谢你啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
